# buusdo brand (Buusdo product line)

This repository ships **buusdo Cybersecurity Service Tool** (member of the Buusdo line).

- Official name: **buusdo Cybersecurity Service Tool**
- Short UI lockup: **buusdo** + tagline **Cybersecurity Service Tool** (`shared/brand.json`)
- Logo assets: `public/brand/buusdo-logo.png`, `public/brand/buusdo-wordmark.png` (sync to `shared/brand/`, `extension/icons/`, `desktop-app/public/brand/`, `china-pages/assets/`)
- Prefer website brand surfaces before extension/desktop polish
- Legacy on-disk paths may still use `Preventive Shield` / `preventive-shield` — do not rename without a migrate plan
- Other Buusdo products stay in separate workspaces; do not mix unrelated apps into this PR
